> However, a lemure is also a real animal.  A fuzzy, little, tree-hanging
> prosimian with big eyes and a long fluffy tail.  

And both are called after the original lemures, which were Roman spirits
of the dead which hadn't departed to Hades, usually because they hadn't
had a decent burial, and remained to pester the living.

The biggest problem with searching for these on the Web is that NetHack
